Driver named in fatal crash =
near Apple Park that killed 2-year-old Riley Howard

A Santa Clara man, Eric Chen Su, 38, was arrested on suspicion of gross =
vehicular manslaughter in the crash near Apple=E2=80=99s Cupertino =
headquarters that killed 2-year-old Riley Kathryn Howard.

What changed: The Santa Clara County medical examiner=E2=80=99s office =
identified the toddler on Monday. Investigators developed probable cause to=
 arrest Su but have not determined all the circumstances surrounding the =
crash.

KTVU FOX 2, Nov 9 &middot; Forward

Update: Tang, Fruen and =
Lindskog win Cupertino=E2=80=99s three council seats

Decision Desk HQ=E2=80=99s Nov. 9 tally lists John Tang, J.R. Fruen and =
Seema Lindskog as the winners of the three at-large Cupertino City Council =
seats.

What changed: Tang finished with 7,919 votes (17.57%), Fruen with 7=
,386 (16.39%) and Lindskog with 7,221 (16.02%), after earlier partial =
counts had them leading. San Jos=C3=A9 Spotlight reports that seating the =
three Cupertino Together candidates would swing the council majority from =
preservationist to pro-growth for four years.

Decision Desk HQ, Nov 9 =
&middot; Forward

Japan=E2=80=99s biggest curry chain CoCo Ichibanya plans =
first Bay Area restaurant in Cupertino

CoCo Ichibanya USA

CoCo Ichibanya, Japan=E2=80=99s dominant curry rice chain, plans to open =
its first Bay Area restaurant in Cupertino in mid-December.

Zoom in: The roughly 50-seat spot is at 19900 Vallco Pkwy., Suite 100, with=
 customizable toppings like chicken cutlets, stewed beef, garlic shrimp, =
spinach and cheese. At Southern California locations, a classic chicken =
cutlet curry goes for $15.85.

SF Chronicle via Yahoo, Nov 8 &middot; =
Forward

California=E2=80=99s Great America announces 2027 will be its =
final season

California=E2=80=99s Great America in Santa Clara announced =
Friday that 2027 will be its final season after more than 50 years.

Why it matters: Park officials say the land lease expires in June 2028 and =
will not be renewed. The Farewell Season opens in March 2027 and ends on =
Labor Day 2027, with operating days and hours to be announced later.

KRON4, Nov 6 &middot; Forward

Santa Clara man tied to school shooting =
plans accused of lying to buy guns

Prosecutors said Friday that Clayton =
Girard, 27, of Santa Clara, who was committed to a mental institution after=
 authorities found plans for a school shooting, lied about his mental =
health history to buy 11 firearms.

Zoom in: Girard was arrested Oct. 22, =
and the guns included AR-style rifles, semiautomatic pistols and shotguns, =
according to the U.S. Attorney=E2=80=99s Office for Northern California. If=
 convicted, he faces up to 10 years in prison and a $250,000 fine for each =
violation of federal law.

Local News Matters, Nov 7 &middot; Forward

Quick Hits

Santa Clara=E2=80=99s City Council unanimously ended senior =
center membership fees, which had been $12 basic and $37 premium.

San Jose could approve Google=E2=80=99s Alviso data center before the city =
finalizes its development standards, a deputy city manager said.

San Jose police arrested nine people, three of them juveniles, over =
commercial burglaries and about 50 vehicle break-ins.



